#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-pixhawk6C.rst:43
#: 177ba66509804bf79414d33b7dca47d7 379dfa41b9fc4afdbc5d04b2fc87f118
#: 3abd3b17bd9147518342be74780bc7a2 3e2359aa36f342b4919052c90c15d596
#: 64d9e1265a2d445788d8272ad8a98205 906ef39abfe041d2b7787b16cbdac811
msgid ""
"The RCIN pin, which by default is mapped to a timer input, can be used for "
"all ArduPilot supported receiver protocols, except CRSF/ELRS and SRXL2 which"
" require a true UART connection. However, FPort, when connected in this "
"manner, will only provide RC without telemetry."
msgstr ""
"RCIN 引脚默认映射为定时器输入，可用于所有 ArduPilot 支持的接收机协议，但 CRSF/ELRS 和 SRXL2 除外（这两种协议需要真正的"
" UART 连接）。但 FPort 以此方式连接时，仅提供 RC 而无数传。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-pixhawk6C.rst:45
#: 0bcca20f66c348568cb6acf1d8628629 6d03aefcf8de4c9180e7efe1c5bbada5
#: a03ea64374274b2c9100832069c74354 abc29f6bb9134be3b0ab0c5663d84cf8
#: d269e574757f4c0fa19518119cc19f3f f34a2ec0c9ef486b8bedcd958a461607
msgid ""
"To allow CRSF and embedded telemetry available in Fport, CRSF, and SRXL2 "
"receivers, a full UART, such as SERIAL5 (UART3) would need to be used for "
"receiver connections. Below are setups using Serial6. For the 6C Mini, "
"SERIAL1 - SERIAL4 would need to be used."
msgstr ""
"为支持 FPort、CRSF 和 SRXL2 接收机中的嵌入式数传，需使用完整 UART（如 SERIAL5（UART3））进行接收机连接。以下为使用 "
"Serial6 的设置。对于 6C Mini，需使用 SERIAL1 至 SERIAL4。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-pixhawk6C.rst:47
#: 4240c8afbfd949f9a0c0cf04d1c235a0 65a2bfb0ac874c54aad2e3693f221fd0
