"SRXL2 would require :ref:`SERIAL5_OPTIONS<SERIAL5_OPTIONS>` be set to \"4\" "
"and connects only the TX pin."
msgstr "SRXL2 需要将 :ref:`SERIAL5_OPTIONS<SERIAL5_OPTIONS>` 设置为 「4」，并仅连接 TX 引脚。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-pixhawk6C.rst:55
#: 013e120837684df88e629b57a703f52c 05bd2d7e7e57473aa37367eb8412ba60
